      "lead_summary": "Knot Island, also known as One Island,  is a town that be accessed from the East by Kindle Road and from the South by Treasure Beach.\nIn the PokéCenter, Bebe and a scientist are looking for a Network Adapter they lost, which can be found in Kindle Road. After helping them, Bebe will give the player the Box Link.",
